tica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">月之暗面计划于今年第三季度正式发布 Kimi K3 大模型，参数规模达 2.5 万亿</span></section></section><section style=\"display:flex;margin-bottom:16px;align-items:baseline;\"><section style=\"flex-shrink:0;width:36px;text-align:left;\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-weight:900;color:rgb(92,11,214);font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-style:italic;line-height:1;\">04</span></section><section style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:#1f1f1f;letter-spacing:.5px;line-height:1.6;text-align:justify;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Helvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">商汤科技发布原生理解生成统一模型SenseNova U1并开源轻量版</span></section></section><section style=\"display:flex;margin-bottom:16px;align-items:baseline;\"><section style=\"flex-shrink:0;width:36px;text-align:left;\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-weight:900;color:rgb(92,11,214);font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-style:italic;line-height:1;\">05</span></section><section style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:#1f1f1f;letter-spacing:.5px;line-height:1.6;text-align:justify;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Helvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">Mistral AI发布企业级编排工具Workflows，支持Python开发与人工审批</span></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:10px auto;text-align:center;\"><section style=\"display:inline-block;\"><section style=\"margin-top:-4px;padding:0 40px;outline:0;font-size:24px;letter-spacing:1.5px;\"><strong><span leaf=\"\">新闻速览</span></strong></section><section style=\"margin-top:-2px;width:182px;height:2px;background-color:rgb(58,19,228);overflow:hidden;\"><span leaf=\"\"><br></span></section><section style=\"margin-top:3px;width:182px;height:1px;background-color:rgb(111,19,209);overflow:hidden;\"><span leaf=\"\"><br></span></section><section style=\"outline:0;font-size:12px;letter-spacing:1.5px;color:rgb(92,11,214);transform:scale(.9);\"><span leaf=\"\">NEWS GLANCE</span></section></section></section><section id=\"xiangqing\"><section id=\"content1\"><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">谷歌DeepMind CEO哈萨比斯访韩，联手三星现代推动AI技术实物化</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/bcb1f9ad4d8ab4252769fa94ce9fae6f.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">谷歌DeepMind首席执行官德米斯·哈萨比斯（Demis Hassabis）于4月27日开启韩国访问行程，先后与三星电子、LG集团及现代汽车高层会晤，旨在推动AI技术从云端向终端设备迁移。此次访问的核心目标是实现AI“实物化”，即通过将DeepMind先进的算法模型植入实体设备，使其转化为生产力工具。韩国企业在半导体、消费电子及汽车制造领域的工业落地能力，被视为DeepMind实现该战略的理想支撑。双方合作重点涵盖AI芯片研发、智能车载系统及家电物联网等领域。此次高规格会晤标志着全球顶级AI算力中心与世界一流制造业的深度融合，旨在通过软硬件协同，加速AI技术在实体产业的落地应用，共同开启AI技术实物化发展的新阶段。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">蚂蚁集团百灵大模型系列更新，Ling-2.6-flash正式开源</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/0693f8904d82c3c2ffda47600dc60e67.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">蚂蚁集团百灵大模型系列迎来更新，Ling-2.6-flash正式向全球开发者开源。该模型总参数量104B，激活参数量7.4B，提供BF16、FP8及INT4多精度版本。在4卡H20环境下，其推理速度最高达340 tokens/s，Prefill吞吐量为Nemotron-3-Super的2.2倍。研发团队通过深度校准Token效率，使其完成同等任务的消耗仅为竞品的十分之一，显著降低商用成本。针对Agent场景，Ling-2.6-flash在工具调用与多步规划方面表现稳健，在BFCL-V4、SWE-bench等评测中达到SOTA水平。该模型此前曾以“Elephant Alpha”身份在OpenRouter测试，现已针对中英文切换及编程框架适配完成优化。开发者可通过Hugging Face及ModelScope获取模</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">月之暗面计划于今年第三季度正式发布 Kimi K3 大模型，参数规模达 2.5 万亿</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/771388504ca418bb53c19b1e1546d63c.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">月之暗面计划于今年第三季度正式发布下一代主力模型 Kimi K3，该模型参数规模将达到 2.5 万亿，旨在进一步提升国产大模型的算力与容量上限。在核心性能方面，Kimi K3 将延续并强化其长文本处理优势，上下文长度标准提升至约 100 万字，以支持更复杂的文档分析、代码库处理及大规模数据集交互。此次发布是月之暗面在 K2.6 版本发布仅一周后的又一重大动作，体现了其紧凑的迭代节奏。此前，月之暗面已通过 K2.5 模型实现 1 亿美元的年经常性收入（ARR），并展现了极强的工程落地与资源利用效率。Kimi K3 的推出将直接拉高国产大模型行业的竞争门槛，标志着万亿级参数模型的竞赛进入白热化阶段，为用户提供更具深度理解力的 AI 交互体验。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">商汤科技发布原生理解生成统一模型SenseNova U1并开源轻量版</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/29460e7cc1a7293df696ca27bd39b8e2.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">4月28日，商汤科技正式发布并开源“日日新SenseNova U1”系列原生理解生成统一模型。该系列基于商汤3月自研的NEO-unify架构，摒弃了传统多模态模型通过视觉与语言模块“拼接”的路径，在单一模型框架内实现了多模态理解、推理与生成的深度统一。通过构建统一表征空间，该架构有效解决了信息在不同表征空间传递时的损耗问题，显著提升了模型对复杂信息的感知深度及生成内容的精准度。商汤此次率先开源了SenseNova U1 Lite轻量版，包含两个规格模型，代码及文件已上线开源平台。官方表示，未来将推出参数规模更大的版本。此架构的成熟标志着国产AI从“功能叠加”向“结构进化”转型，将为自动驾驶、智能硬件及工业协作等领域提供更高效的技术支撑。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">Mistral AI发布企业级编排工具Workflows，支持Python开发与人工审批</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/bbabdbf13b0519714ed26a472df3379a.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">Mistral AI正式推出企业级AI编排工具Workflows，现已进入公开预览阶段，旨在助力企业将AI流程转化为生产级系统。该工具基于Temporal引擎构建，支持开发人员使用Python定义复杂工作流，并引入“人工在环”机制，通过一行代码即可在关键节点设置人工审批，确保业务合规与安全。敏感数据保留在客户自有系统，员工可通过Le Chat触发自动化序列。目前，ASML、ABANCA及CMA-CGM等企业已将其应用于核心业务。此次发布补齐了Mistral AI从底层模型到应用编排的全栈能力，标志着其业务重心从简单对话转向复杂任务自动化，将显著加速AI技术在严谨商业场景中的工程化落地。</section></section></section></section><section style=\"text-align:center;\"><img data-src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/xm1dT1jCe8lWwznuFM0USlcQ4HAb5iapyGyBVUyRZOyLbF3SaPphbdlF7K9R7YLicicIjdeAPueYcKHJDZEiceeUFQ/640?wx_fmt=png\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-ratio=\"0.4255555555555556\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"900\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/xm1dT1jCe8lWwznuFM0USlcQ4HAb5iapyGyBVUyRZOyLbF3SaPphbdlF7K9R7YLicicIjdeAPueYcKHJDZEiceeUFQ/640?wx_fmt=png\"></section>",
